title The ratchet and the property it stands for -- the reach gate moves from unheard to unreached
prompt Autonomous loop -- roster cold first, Standfast on reds, next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, rota row N mod 5, condense ITINERARY and refill Now, send each finished increment
think Opened cold. sh tools/fixtures/standing_equipment_run.sh over a clean index read 61 guards, 61 green, 0 red, tree_at_open and tree_at_close both 902a103aeb53, tree_moved=no, run_verdict=ok. Both living rows in construction/REDS.md read CLOSED, so no standfast stood and the line was clear.
think Rota row 4 by lap index. git rev-list --count HEAD read 3434 at the open, so 3434 mod 5 = 4 -- Earth and Mercury, the concrete: the one-clock naming law, Two Rooms, the marked value. Two Rooms governed this lap directly: a claim crosses into the checkable room by exactly one door, which is a witness, and the question underneath this round is what the witness on the other side of that door is actually measuring. Row 3, Water and Venus, went unread again -- the commit-count reading skipped it, which is the drift 20260825.152119 measured and proposed to fix by advancing per lap; that change is Keaton's word and the seated reading stayed in force here.
think Took the next door the card named -- the equinox family at 123 -- and started with the measurement rather than the choir. Grouping the unheard list by suffix read 80 of the 123 as themselves *_choir_witness.rish files. A choir nothing runs is REDS %219's own subject, so the question turned around: how many witnesses does the meter count as `sung` while no roster row reaches the runner doing the naming?
think Measured it with the meter's own two readings rather than a new tool. sh tools/fixtures/witness_reach_scan.sh --sung minus the union of --standing and --cadence returned 265 paths. Checked one by hand to be sure the walk was honest: tools/b/buhr_mantra_browser_view_witness.rish is named by buhr_mantra_browser_heads_witness.rish and buhr_mantra_browser_view_theme_witness.rish, and the roster reaches neither. The rest follows by construction -- a path lands in that set exactly when the closure from every roster root stops short of it.
think Named the red and booked it. The ceiling stood on `unheard`, and that number falls when a choir is WRITTEN rather than when one is ROSTERED: list a hundred witnesses in a new file, leave it off construction/standing-equipment.kyri, and the ratchet drops by a hundred while the same guards run. The property the roster's own header names -- a guard that is never run guards nothing either -- would stand exactly where it stood. REDS %224.
think Moved the gate rather than adding a second one. tools/fixtures/witness_reach_scan.sh now writes three more sets from the two closures it already walked -- `reached` (standing + cadence), `unreached` (all minus reached), `unclocked` (sung intersect unreached) -- and CEILING holds `unreached` at 1202. Single-stranded: one gate, on the number that means the promise, and strictly stronger, since unheard is a subset of unreached so nothing formerly caught now passes. Two comm calls, no second traversal.
think Made the family census follow the gate. --families now groups `unreached` and --families-unheard keeps the older reading, because a family count and a ceiling that cover different sets is how a lap comes to believe a family is closer to done than it is. equinox reads 144 rather than 123 under the new census; glow 90, hunk 86, mycelium 80.
think Proved the promotion by doing it rather than by argument. The control plants an off-roster choir, appends a roster row for it, commits, and re-reads: the member must leave `unclocked` for `standing` and `unreached` must fall by exactly the two files that moved. That check bit its own author -- it read 7 to 6 for a promotion of two files, because its `git add -A` had tracked tools/w/untracked_two_witness.rish, the plant sitting one check above it whose whole job is to stay untracked. Scoped the add to the roster file and wrote the reason beside it; a control's own plants are state, and a step that stages everything walks through them.
obs The gate was proven from both sides on the living tree as well as on the pen. WITNESS_REACH_CEILING=1201 reads under_ceiling=no and the witness exits 1 naming the ceiling; at 1202 it reads yes and GREEN. A refusal proven only in the passing direction cannot be told from a bypass.
obs The honest limit is unchanged and stays named in the scan header. An invocation through a variable the meter cannot resolve is invisible to it, so `unreached` is an UPPER bound on what is truly unrun. It proves a witness is reachable from a roster row; whether that row's guard asserts anything worth asserting is a reading a person takes.
obs What this does not decide: which tier a family belongs on. That stays a cost decision made with a stopwatch, which is why the equinox door still opens with one rather than with a choir.
obs The ledger fold was forced by arithmetic rather than chosen. The new row is 2,885 bytes and construction/REDS.md stood at 23,512 against 24,576, so row %222 folded to construction/archive/REDS-a-tier-from-one-sample-rows-222.md with its link depth moved, and the headline's derived remainder moved 203 to 204 -- caught by tools/gen/season/reds_ledger_monotone_witness.rish, which refused `verdict=headline_drift` before it would go green.
