recommend keep-going the equinox stopwatch is the next crux and it is now a well-posed question -- run the 123 unheard witnesses under tools/gen/season/, record pass and per-witness seconds, and let the cost decide the tier before any choir is written, since under the new gate a choir without a roster row moves nothing at all
